OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPerhaps some
OL,6,Fearly evening brightness in the
OL,7,Fsoutheast, but otherwise it will be
OL,8,Fmostly cloudy tonight with outbreaks
OL,9,Fof rain and drizzle. Winds soon
OL,10,Feasing. Mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FRemaining cloudy on Tuesday
OL,13,Fwith outbreaks of rain and drizzle at
OL,14,Ftimes. Light winds. Cooler than Monday.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FEarly
OL,17,Frain clearing to sunshine and showers
OL,18,FWednesday. Chilly start Thursday, then
OL,19,Fsunny spells and coastal showers. Wind
OL,20,Fand rain arriving later, clearing to
OL,21,Fsunshine and showers during Friday.
